## Quickstart

```bash
# 1) Bring everything up. First run downloads base boxes (~5-8 GB).
vagrant up

# 2) Watch status:
vagrant status

# 3) SSH into any Linux node:
vagrant ssh <hostname>

# 4) Tear down when you're done:
vagrant destroy -f
```

> First `vagrant up` takes ~10 minutes for box downloads (cached after that)
> plus ~5–10 minutes for provisioning to converge. Subsequent `vagrant up`
> reuses cached boxes and is much faster.

