## Troubleshooting

* **`vagrant up` hangs on "default: Waiting for machine to boot..."** — usually
  WinRM / SSH timeout; try `vagrant reload <hostname>`.
* **Provisioner errors** — each Linux node logs to
  `/var/log/labforge-provision.log` inside the VM. Windows nodes log to
  `C:\Labforge\provision.log`. SSH/WinRM in and tail the log.
* **Out of RAM** — reduce the `v.memory` line in the `Vagrantfile` for
  whichever node is hogging. The provisioners are idempotent, so
  `vagrant reload --provision <hostname>` is safe.
* **Box download fails** — most boxes live on
  https://app.vagrantup.com/ — confirm you can reach it from the host.
